---
kind: scene
id: cafe.hello
title: The cafe
---
/*
Scoped stamps on every named surface, one host token, and two plugin directives.

  - `assetName` on `::bg` is a string; on `::showSpeaker` the same name is an
    int (one name, two types on disjoint surfaces).
  - `voiceAssetId` is a stamp of content lines only.
  - `menuType` is a stamp of `<branch>`; `optionKey` is a required stamp of
    every `<choice>`.
  - `{{playerName}}` and `{{rank:ordinal}}` are host tokens: the engine
    substitutes them, and the runtime leaves the marker in the rendered text.
*/

## The door {#door}

::bg{location="cafe" time="day" assetName="BG_cafe"}
::showSpeaker{character="mira" spriteId="SPR_mira_01" assetName="7"}
@mira{voiceAssetId="VO.mira.0010"}: Welcome, {{playerName}}. You are our {{rank:ordinal}} guest today.
::move{mode="walk" speed="slow"}
@narrator: She leads you between the tables.

<branch id="route" prompt="Where do you sit?" menuType="plain">
  <choice id="window" text="By the window" optionKey="L1">
    @mira{voiceAssetId="VO.mira.0020"}: Good light there.
  </choice>
  <choice id="counter" text="At the counter" optionKey="R1">
    @mira{voiceAssetId="VO.mira.0030"}: Closer to the coffee.
  </choice>
</branch>
